OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal waste site to cost 'more
OL,4,Athan #1m' to clear
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has said more than #1
OL,7,Fmillion has been approved to clear an
OL,8,Fillegal waste dump in Leicestershire.
OL,10,FHinckley and Bosworth Borough Council
OL,11,F(HBBC) met last week to agree the
OL,12,Ffunding, which will see it pay up to
OL,13,F#1.3m to clear the tip on land off the
OL,14,FA47 Leicester Road between Hinckley and
OL,15,FEarl Shilton.
OL,17,FThe site had previously been touted for
OL,18,Fa crematorium, but HBBC scrapped those
OL,19,Fplans and instead hopes to sell the
OL,20,Fland to a developer.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
