OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal waste site to cost 'more
OL,4,Athan #1m' to clear
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the Local Democracy
OL,7,FReporting Service (LDRS), the council's
OL,8,FLiberal Democrat leader Stuart Bray
OL,9,Fsaid: "It's going to cost me, and
OL,10,Feverybody else, an absolute fortune,
OL,11,Fand the council is the victim."
